[47] But if ye believe not his writings, how shall ye believe my words?</p></div></div></article><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3"><h3 class="kjt-pm-group font-display text-purple-deep">The promise</h3><details class="group border-line overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(62,9,63,0.05)] kjt-pm" data-kjt-pm="30"><summary class="hover:bg-purple-soft flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition sm:px-6 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="font-display text-purple-deep text-lg leading-snug sm:text-xl">1 - The Seed of the Woman will crush the serpent’s head (Genesis 3:15)</span><span class="bg-purple-soft text-purple-deep flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Toggle passage</span></span></summary><div class="border-line video-rail max-h-[22rem] overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain border-t px-5 py-5 sm:px-6"><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-ink text-base leading-8 whitespace-pre-line"><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="https://knowingjesus.today/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Genesis/3/15" title="Open Genesis 3:15 in Bible Search">Genesis 3:15</a>
