.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Toggle passage</span></span></summary><div class="border-line video-rail max-h-[22rem] overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain border-t px-5 py-5 sm:px-6"><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-ink text-base leading-8 whitespace-pre-line"><a class="text-purple font-bold underline underline-offset-4" data-wpel-link="internal" href="https://knowingjesus.today/bible-corner/#/p/kjva/Genesis/22/18" title="Open Genesis 22:18 in Bible Search">Genesis 22:18</a>
